	"About the Cover" note by Rick Sternbach (in which he admits that the starmap on the
	cover would be no more than 0.001 inch across if it were to the same scale as the
	Milky Way painting, and that he has hidden "fourteen black holes, two Puppeteer-built
	General Products spacecraft hulls, egg-shaped Jinx, and ... there. The Ringworld, too,
	of course." I [Raja Thiagarajan, sthiagar@nickel.ucs.indiana.edu] would be interested
	in hearing from anyone who found these ;-)|
